=== DEPLOYMENT.md
     1	The changed function is search.js. name is attacker-controlled, including quotes. The database connection can read all users.
     2	db.js receives a genuine node-postgres client. Its verified contract transmits query text and the optional values array separately; values cannot alter SQL syntax. Query text itself is executed as SQL. No value validation occurs before search.
=== db.js
     1	export function adapter(client) { return { query(text, values) { return client.query(text, values); } }; }
